wip/py-mitsuba: Import py-mitsuba-3.9.1

Mitsuba 3 is a retargetable forward and inverse (differentiable)
renderer built on Dr.Jit (wip/py-drjit). Variants: scalar_rgb,
scalar_spectral, llvm_ad_rgb, llvm_ad_spectral and, on macOS,
metal_ad_rgb.

Uses pkgsrc's zlib, OpenEXR 3, libpng, libjpeg, pugixml and fast_float
instead of the bundled submodules. CPU ray tracing uses the bundled
Embree 3.13 fork: Mitsuba needs the Embree 3 API (wip/embree is 4.x)
and its built-in kernel misses geometry on the bounding box boundary.
